
Create one new account in old server and add to administrator:
--------------------------------------------------------------
 
1.) Build a new server with diff hostname & ip/ join to domain
2.) On old DC before demote - Check if holds any FSMO roles and move to another available DC
3.) Demote the DC completely, Delete from sites and service, Delete AD object also /untick the network connection,power-off the vm atlast
4.) On new build move the server to Workgroup-restart and once up change the ipaddress then computername/description - reboot
5.) now join the new vm to domain back
6.) Install AD & DNS services - restart / Once VM is up from Add or remove roles- Click the promote DC flag at the top of server manger window
7.) TO promote the DC -Choose 1 option to add DC to existing domain
8.) For replication it takes time 25/30 mins
9.) In DNS console - Hostname-RC-properties- update the forwarders tab with all infoblox ip
10.) If any ip failed to resovle open FW request for DNS port 53
